{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_04_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_04",
  "title": "他是将军",
  "storyCode": "OF-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "61c8e75a705e7abb19ccec8fa0166b7023ba59305b1d380a11f40d66d3fa7442",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
      "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
      "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "这个菲林族女性并非泛泛之辈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这还是难不倒你的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "将军，没受伤吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "不必担心。她的部下都只是些庸人。你们安全之后，撤退对我来说还算轻松。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "只不过，关于这个保镖的身份，我有些猜测。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "身份",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "难道说......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "哥伦比亚，菲林族，女性，银发、金瞳、黑弩。是杀手，也是佣兵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "杀手闻名于诸城是件可耻的事，但这些传闻实在是过于有名。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "譬如说，毁掉一整个哥伦比亚家族。一个强盛的家族，重要人物在数年内陆续暴毙，逐渐走向衰落，最终彻底被除名。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "再如，猎杀一整支巡逻队。这支巡逻队在哥伦比亚边境烧杀抢掠，自诩野蛮人的征服者，不断地向异族施加暴行和惨剧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "之后的一个月内，他们在山间逃窜，不断死去，最后只剩下一个残废回到城市胡言乱语。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "以及向我叙说故事的人的遭遇。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "又发生了什么？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "请说吧，我不害怕。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "不必多说了。他的伤疤从左肩延伸到右脚后跟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "杀人如麻的家伙比比皆是，我也如此。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "当然，这个杀手失踪已久。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "只是，如果她就是那个人，那么摆在我们面前的，自然是腥风血雨。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "水比想象中的深。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "锡兰被蒙在鼓里？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "也许市长并非不知情。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "不如说，如果她是市长的杀手，我不会感到奇怪。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "（玻璃杯粉碎）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "锡兰？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你从什么时候......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "锡兰小姐，你不用躲着偷听。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我，我想给你们倒杯水......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "赫拉格爷爷，那个佣兵，是从什么时候开始活动，又是在什么时候失踪的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "她的事迹开始闻名，甚至在我还未退伍之时。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "而她销声匿迹则是一年之前，随着那个家族的覆灭一起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "......直到六年前，黑都在维多利亚照顾我的生活。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "但是有一天，她忽然说爸爸需要她回去做事，就走了，只在每年圣诞节的时候来接我回家。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "但、但是，她刚才只是态度不好，而且听了别人的命令，黑她怎么可能是那种杀人如麻的杀手！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "而且，按照你们的说法，你们想说克洛宁的背后是我爸爸在授意吗？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我不信！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "我不作推测。但我也说过，即使是最信任的人，也未必对你毫无保留。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "信与不信，我不关心。只是，她身上的乌萨斯制式武器留下的伤痕，我绝不会看错。这支队伍被埋葬在大雪中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "现状如你所见，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "如果火山的情报处理也有市政府参与，那么这件事我们未必应该插手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "锡兰小姐，你也应该看清事实。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我......我需要冷静一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "博士，请。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我是该做些什么吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "自然。现在她需要一个能够理解她的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
